source: tests/help_snapshots.rs
---
Show one property of a run, in full: its name, ID, group, category, team, status, example totals, and sample moments.

`property_id` is the id field of a property that `runs_properties` returns. Property lookup needs a run created on release 65.3 or later.

Examples:
  runs_property {"run_id": "<run_id>", "property_id": "<property_id>"}

The property prints as one JSON object.
